Changes made to each upstream file: variables were rewritten to this
platform's forms, relative bind mounts became named volumes, keys with no
equivalent were dropped, health checks were adjusted to HTTP probes where
the upstream used a bare TCP check, and the file was split into a
template.yaml manifest and a compose.yaml. The `source:` block of each
manifest names the upstream file it came from.

